{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cA horror RPG where monsters never die \u2014 survive, rescue victims, and escape the Folded World before your soul is lost forever.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840590/extras/6cccc39a29dde7526d27f26bbb94595d.avif?t=1773330424\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Folded World, a distorted parallel universe where urban legends like Bloody Mary, Jiangshi, and the Backrooms hunt the lost. As an Agent, you have 49 minutes to rescue victims and break 7 mirrors that guarantee your exit. But beware: the monsters don\u2019t die. Each death deducts 7 minutes from your time, and if you run out of time completely, your soul deteriorates and you become a shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your equipment strategically:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Blaster \u2014 long-range attack with limited charges </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Reaper \u2014 repels creatures and provides protection, but deals low damage </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Amulet \u2014 healing and elemental damage, with limited charges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in mirrors or tall grass to recover sanity, plan routes, and conserve resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay loop and tension</strong> During exploration:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Weak enemies roam the maps \u2022 An immortal monster appears during Terror Hour \u2022 Every decision affects your time and sanity \u2022 Rescuing victims grants advantages and extends your survival \u2022 Combat is dangerous and strategic; often, fleeing is the best choice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is challenging: every minute counts, and every mistake visibly affects your character\u2019s appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840590/extras/346e7f0a877ffc47a7561c59299dc29f.avif?t=1773330424\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >85 adaptive maps with dynamic weather and unsettling music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Sanity affects damage dealt: above 90% you suffer penalties; 70\u201390% doubles damage \u2022 Over 100 skills and 50 items requiring strategic management \u2022 Dark story and pacts involving Lee, Nyx, and Seth \u2022 Mature themes: extreme violence, psychological torment, betrayal, sacrifice \u2022 Support for 5 languages: English, Portuguese, Chinese, Russian, and Japanese</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840590/extras/8e8e17475175bf80100e4e00621b873b.avif?t=1773330424\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Agents of Shadow is for adult audiences. The game contains extreme violence, psychological horror, difficult moral choices, and graphic horror elements. Survival depends on strategy, timing, and resource management.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840590?t=1773330424","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840590?t=1773330424","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840590/f7b5262b995d48ab943a51ef0a233fe23682683b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773330424","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840590/f7b5262b995d48ab943a51ef0a233fe23682683b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773330424","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"de